Description: The browser's 3D menus lose the separation, screen plane and device type strings; the Display Configuration label and the two notices (ORDER 473u round 3)
 The strings of the removed menus (the 3D Display menu, its modes, depths and screen planes, the 3D Canvas menu's depths, the
 phone and headset hints and mode names) go from eight languages; the Display Configuration item's label (KDE's own name for
 kcm_kscreen, with KDE's own translations) and the two notices of the notification bar (a 3D scene that stays flat for want
 of depth limits, Display Configuration that could not be opened) are added in each: waterfox/browser/locales/LOCALE/browser/browser/browserContext.ftl.
 Applies after the 3D Display strings.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
---
